From 68197240bdf1dd480c0e5bd3349cd1b0022ac61f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hfatehi <trialoftheniku@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 03:07:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] ALFA: rename the base card to
 delphes_card_ALFA_template.tcl (not for production)

The base card holds the first-pass ARCPID placeholders of the original bundle and is only the
source of make_cards.py; renamed and given a header so it is not mistaken for a production card.
make_cards.py reads the template and drops that header; README runs the Xe2bar card. The two
production cards change only in their first comment line (the template name).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KP5vqAGH2XiGXWtPhaonke
---
 cards/delphes_card_ALFA_C4F10.tcl                     |  2 +-
 cards/delphes_card_ALFA_Xe2bar.tcl                    |  2 +-
 ...s_card_ALFA.tcl => delphes_card_ALFA_template.tcl} |  7 +++++++
 examples/ALFA/README.md                               | 11 +++++++----
 examples/ALFA/make_cards.py                           |  5 +++--
 5 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 rename cards/{delphes_card_ALFA.tcl => delphes_card_ALFA_template.tcl} (97%)

diff --git a/cards/delphes_card_ALFA_C4F10.tcl b/cards/delphes_card_ALFA_C4F10.tcl
